{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_08",
  "title": "影與灰",
  "storyCode": "GA-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5b64de7ba2cb22852a8ea8e1c0e0ee1594dfa9082c9393af78cf6375fb139753",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "算了，自掏腰包吧，這裡的維修費用很貴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "下午茶的甜點往後只能減半了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "text": "教宗閣下！我聽到大教堂方向傳來戰鬥聲，您沒事吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "text": "這是......？！是異端襲擊了您嗎？......這是我的失職！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "別這麼緊張，保拉里奧，還記得上次大教堂掰腕比賽的冠軍是誰嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "text": "......是您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我只是稍微活動了一下手腕，不小心搞出了一點小意外而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "城內的騷亂已經平息了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "text": "是的，他們撤退了。我都還沒來得及炸爽——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "請問可以進來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "text": "咳咳，抱歉，教宗閣下，我失態了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "text": "我是說，您要找的人已經到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "請進吧，孩子們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "教宗閣下，向您致敬......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "教宗閣下，您好，我是塞茜莉亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "啊，歡迎，這裡有點亂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "你們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "喝茶一般配什麼甜點？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "您......需要我做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "嗯，讓我想想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "往自己的茶杯裡加塊方糖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "艾澤爾，你得多加幾塊，糖分能舒緩緊張。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "啊！好、好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "教宗閣下，如果我......想要離開拉特蘭，您會同意嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "如果我不允許，你會服從嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "可能不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "那就去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......教宗閣下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我只是個可憐的老頭子，最大的願望就是窩在軟乎乎的搖椅裡安度晚年，哪有功夫去管小女孩的旅行計畫呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "可塞茜莉亞是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "是什麼？難不成她還能是天使和魔鬼的混血，讓啟示降臨的聖徒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞只是個想要出門看看的小姑娘，對不對？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "你還帶著你媽媽的守護銃，是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "啊，對不起！我是不是應該交給艾澤爾哥哥......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "沒關係，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "獲得守護銃是一件莊嚴的事，原本得舉行隆重的儀式，需要監護人出席，導師的首肯，還有一大堆麻煩的文書工作......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "不過，你也沒到可以獲得守護銃的年紀。所以，悄悄地把它帶走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "真的可以嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我不敢說這是給你的禮物。每一把銃都是拉特蘭的寶貴財富。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "不過，若只是孩子思念母親的寄託，我相信不會有人阻止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "帶上它吧，孩子。你的身體狀況可能不允許你扣下扳機，幹掉什麼壞蛋......但它能提醒你，不管走到哪裡，你都是從拉特蘭出發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "......嗯，謝謝您，閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "艾澤爾，陪著她一起吧，算你的長期外勤任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "記得偶爾回來看看就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "我......真的有這個資格嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "你當然有。你做出了選擇，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......我會竭盡全力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "別讓塞茜莉亞被欺負了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "行了，去吧，時光可不等人。到了我這個年紀，就只會滿腦子想著睡午覺啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "......教宗爺爺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "我會一直走下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "......是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我將為你祝禱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "教宗閣下，這就足夠了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我和他們一起吃了點心，這就足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "......按照您的指示，那個男人已經離開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我是不是應該多留他一會兒？也許吃塊巧克力能讓他打起點精神？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "......教宗閣下，您太心軟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "不，薇爾麗芙，我們註定無法成為寒夜中的炬火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "但是，為抱薪者端上一杯熱茶......總還是做得到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "“這片大地難以容忍美善”......願那些不承認這一點的人能夠成功。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "我們也該做下一件事了。騷亂已經平息，召集各國使節吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "啟示既昭，我將行我須行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "別這麼想，菲亞梅塔，你不用承擔任何東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "不，這是我的決定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我不管他那時正覬覦什麼力量，想探究什麼秘密，要得到什麼答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我不管他的崇高理想，偉大事業，救贖了誰又引導了誰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我不會原諒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我不為信仰，不為拉特蘭城，不為戍衛隊，甚至不為逝去的時光......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我不原諒，只因為——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "安多恩，你辜負了信任你的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......是你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......為什麼你還能安然無恙地出現在這裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "為什麼連教宗閣下都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "為什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "為什麼......又有什麼為什麼......路從一開始就不存在，又能在虛無中尋得什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "這是你的懺悔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "懺悔？不，我沒有懺悔......何方可供我懺悔？沒有光亮，沒有前途，受難者必將受難，悲哀者只有悲哀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "沒有得救，沒有樂園，這裡是拉特蘭，這裡只屬於我們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "如果光芒本就是虛影......不，不是虛影......是實在......不如我們所願......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "從未有過光芒......又何談照亮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你在說什麼，安多恩？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......我放棄了嗎，我為什麼在這裡，我放棄了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "這障壁如此之厚，我怎麼能夠擁抱他們？我怎麼可以擁抱他們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "或許我只是個兜售虛假希望的騙子......騙到自己也信了這說辭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我不明白，我不明白。它的判斷是什麼？它想讓我去向何方？它的存在本身明明已經堵死了我的道路......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我向何處尋覓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "安多恩！給我清醒一點！看清楚站在你面前的人是誰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "是誰......啊......菲亞梅塔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你又在發什麼瘋？！你那副振振有詞、理直氣壯的樣子呢？你的骨頭被抽走了嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "別讓我對一個癡人瘋漢興師問罪！看清楚你現在在哪裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......我在拉特蘭，菲亞梅塔。我在大教堂之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "很高興與你們重逢......不，我現在一點也不高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......這不是還會抵擋嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你還有臉抵擋？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "說對不起。安多恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "現在，跪下來，對莫斯提馬，還有蕾繆安的方向，說“對不起”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你是覺得自己沒有錯嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我的錯誤不可勝數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你*拉特蘭俚語*還挺得意是不是？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "不曾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "聽著，安多恩，你有什麼信念，我不關心，你的信念全完蛋，我也不在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "蕾繆安原諒你，莫斯提馬原諒你，伊萬傑利斯塔十一世原諒你，就算整個拉特蘭都原諒你——我也絕不原諒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......我很抱歉，菲亞梅塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你該道歉的人不是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......當年的事，若再來一次......也許我仍會這麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......不是吧，認真的？你非要在菲亞梅塔面前這麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "而且你現在不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "很好。安多恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "拿出你的銃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "你知道，這不會有結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你以為我*拉特蘭俚語*是為了結果？！你以為我在這裡把你殺了，蕾繆安的八年就能回來嗎？！莫斯提馬的人生就能復原嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "*拉特蘭俚語*結果！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我要找你算帳，是因為我*拉特蘭俚語*就是要找你算帳！懂了嗎？安多恩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......這是你的執念嗎，菲亞梅塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "是又怎樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我再說一遍，安多恩——拿出你的銃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
